WEBVTT

00:00:01.003 --> 00:00:04.254
SEAMUS: Go get him another towel.
-I want all the judges over here now!

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:08.342
You saved her, even though
she wasn't yours to save.

00:00:09.051 --> 00:00:10.761
My little sister.

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:12.763
Thank you.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:16.141
And you! You helped.

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:20.020
Well, yeah, a bit.

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:26.985
Merci.

00:00:27.069 --> 00:00:28.278
-Harry!
-Hermione! Ow.

00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:31.073
Are you all right? You must be freezing.

00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:34.284
Personally, I think
you behaved admirably.

00:00:34.493 --> 00:00:37.120
I finished last, Hermione. Ah!

00:00:37.287 --> 00:00:41.500
Next to last.
Fleur never got past the Grindylows.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:45.003
KARKAROFF:
Krum! Krum! Krum!

00:00:45.087 --> 00:00:48.048
-Come on! Come on!
-Attention!

00:00:50.175 --> 00:00:53.011
Attention!

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:57.182
The winner is Mr. Diggory...

00:00:57.683 --> 00:01:01.103
...who showed innate command
of the Bubble-Head Charm.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:04.022
However, seeing as Mr. Potter
would have finished first...

00:01:04.106 --> 00:01:09.111
...had it not been for his determination
to rescue not only Mr. Weasley...

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:13.573
...but the others as well,
we've agreed to award him...

00:01:13.824 --> 00:01:15.325
...second place...

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.327
-Yes!
-Second place!

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:20.163
...for outstanding moral fiber!

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:23.125
Yes!

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:24.835
Oh!

00:01:26.712 --> 00:01:28.213
-Right on.
-All that moral fiber, eh?

00:01:28.463 --> 00:01:30.132
-It's great.
-Moral fiber?

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:32.676
Blimey. Even when you go wrong,
it turns out right.

00:01:32.843 --> 00:01:35.470
-Yeah, well done, Moral Fiber.
-Congratulations, Potter.

00:01:35.679 --> 00:01:37.222
-A fine achievement.
-Thank you.

00:01:37.472 --> 00:01:39.057
Well done, boy.

00:01:39.141 --> 00:01:42.436
RON: See you at Hagrid's, Harry.
CROUCH: I'm sorry we haven't spoken.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:46.606
After all, your story is one
I've heard so many times.

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:51.111
Quite remarkable, really.
Tragic, of course...

00:01:51.194 --> 00:01:53.155
...to lose one's family.

00:01:55.198 --> 00:01:57.367
Never whole again, are we?

00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:01.747
Still, life goes on...

00:02:02.372 --> 00:02:04.166
...and here we stand.

00:02:07.127 --> 00:02:09.713
I'm sure your parents would be
very proud of you today, Potter.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.256
Bartemius!

00:02:11.506 --> 00:02:15.635
Not trying to lure Potter into one of the
Ministry's summer internships, are we?

00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:19.181
The last boy who went into the
Department of Mysteries never came out!

00:02:31.485 --> 00:02:33.278
And they say I'm mad.

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:46.291
Now, I remember--
I remember when I first met you all.

00:02:46.541 --> 00:02:49.544
Biggest bunch of misfits
I ever set eyes on.

00:02:50.212 --> 00:02:52.672
Suppose you remind me
of meself a little.

00:02:52.923 --> 00:02:56.927
-And here we all are, four years later.
-We're still a bunch of misfits.

00:02:57.177 --> 00:03:00.305
Well, maybe,
but we've all got each other.

00:03:00.555 --> 00:03:02.140
And Harry, of course.

00:03:02.224 --> 00:03:07.687
Soon to be the youngest
Triwizard champion there's ever been!

00:03:07.938 --> 00:03:09.940
Hooray!

00:03:11.274 --> 00:03:12.692
ALL [SINGING]:
Hogwarts, Hogwarts

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:14.069
Hoggy Warty Hogwarts

00:03:14.236 --> 00:03:16.655
Teach us something, please

00:03:26.581 --> 00:03:28.208
HARRY:
Mr. Crouch?

00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:36.591
DUMBLEDORE:
A man has died here, Fudge.

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:38.802
And he won't be the last.
You must take action.

00:03:38.969 --> 00:03:40.470
FUDGE:
I will not.

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:42.514
In times like these,
the wizard world looks

00:03:42.556 --> 00:03:44.808
to its leaders for strength, Dumbledore!

00:03:44.975 --> 00:03:46.268
DUMBLEDORE:
Then for once show them some!

00:03:46.476 --> 00:03:50.480
The Triwizard Tournament will not be
canceled. I will not be seen as a coward!

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:53.984
DUMBLEDORE: A true leader does what
is right, no matter what others think.

00:03:54.192 --> 00:03:56.945
-What did you say to me?
MOODY: Excuse me, gentlemen.

00:03:57.112 --> 00:04:00.740
It may interest you to know
this conversation is no longer private.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.621
Oh, Harry!

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:09.207
Harry, how good to see you again.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.376
I can come back later, professor.

00:04:11.585 --> 00:04:15.005
Not necessary, Harry. The minister and I
are done. I'll be back in a moment.

00:04:15.255 --> 00:04:17.716
Minister, after you.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:20.260
There you are. Your hat.

00:04:20.343 --> 00:04:24.139
Oh, Harry, do feel free to indulge in
a little Licorice Snap in my absence.

00:04:24.306 --> 00:04:27.350
But I have to warn you,
they're a wee bit sharp.

00:04:53.543 --> 00:04:55.045
Aah!

00:05:58.942 --> 00:06:00.443
Professor?

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:00.613
-Professor.
-Yeah.
